[{"title":"尘","author":"余旭","text":"纷纷浮世暝霏霏，来往长看满客衣。\n驿路每随香雾起，沙堤长逐朔风飞。\n丹砂功就应难染，明镜台空已觉非。\n自愧半生飘泊迹，畴能为我息斯机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32891,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"霜花","author":"余旭","text":"铅华积素瑩娟娟，布粟成花有底妍。\n万点珠星凝碧瓦，千枝粉干缀银笺。\n江桥曙色迷行骑，草塞寒光接远天。\n自是南琛风景薄，若为佳瑞兆丰年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32892,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅魂","author":"余旭","text":"春早幽寻雪未乾，冰肌寥赖月中寒。\n魄依东阁吟边返，影落孤山梦里残。\n怨断宫妆嗟别久，曲终羌曲吊归难。\n几回忆得罗浮事，醉舞东风更倚栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32893,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白雁","author":"余旭","text":"传书曾听渡金河，万里霜翎带雪过。\n夜傍星桥珠错落，朝飞露渚玉婆娑。\n横江影动沧波白，背月辉澄素练多。\n莫道衡阳归路杳，海天风景易蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32894,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡蝶","author":"余旭","text":"暝宿园林昼日长，芳心冉冉惜馀光。\n不禁涧底风泉冷，偏爱花间露叶香。\n梦怯林莺啼上苑，魂随野草落荒塘。\n未知曾见庄生否，懒却寻香过画墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32895,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无弦琴","author":"余旭","text":"何人千里寄孤琴，有轸无弦恨转深。\n花落不随流水调，月明空忆越江吟。\n久惭石上难留兴，每负灯前独赏心。\n遥忆伯牙千载后，惟君与我是知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32896,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游丝","author":"余旭","text":"弄影晴空处处奇，轻浮偏住落花枝。\n千经暗织春情懒，万缕閒萦昼景迟。\n带雨依微牵露网，因风撩乱藉蛛丝。\n何人为报天孙道，欲制云绡得几时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32897,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄文一侄","author":"谢矩","text":"湖海老为客，行行身独单。\n念汝久暌离，十年应未还。\n邈哉渔阳城，万里程途难。\n读书不负志，宁辞远家山。\n努力踵遗芳，庶可慰衰颜。\n封诗远寄将，临风泪潺潺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32898,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘孝廉省亲","author":"谢矩","text":"酌君西亭别离酒，赠君阳关断肠曲。\n秋江落日芙蓉红，不忍双眸凝远绿。\n忆昔同窗话知己，几度芹宫看秋水。\n君今万里奉晨昏，好把辛勤事甘旨。\n丈夫志气本四方，政须念昔悬弧桑。\n雁声后夜楚天碧，倚楼我亦遥相望。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32899,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"谢矩","text":"朔雪酿严寒，舟行午亦眠。\n风狂帆自落，堤远缆须牵。\n柳线垂新岁，梅花尚旧年。\n相逢尽湖海，一笑晚霞前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32900,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪云堂为陆进士赋","author":"谢矩","text":"卜筑向林泉，云深若洞天。\n无心来远岫，有脉自深渊。\n鹤舞添晴影，松鸣动壑弦。\n道人名利淡，对此足忘年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32901,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏日本人","author":"谢矩","text":"浮杯东渡海，天外远游人。\n席地还存古，圆颅不尚巾。\n结跏翻贝叶，合掌礼金身。\n圣德如天大，华夷囿一春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32902,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京口","author":"谢矩","text":"六代风流地，江南第一州。\n东通吴会郡，西接汉湘流。\n铁瓮城何壮，金山寺更幽。\n维舟试登览，今古若浮沤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32903,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答勇斋张先生见怀韵","author":"谢矩","text":"伯兮清誉重丘山，叔也今欣解组閒。\n书屋三间云掩映，江村一曲水回环。\n青云羡尔人中杰，白发惭予镜里颜。\n逸兴缅怀陶靖节，东篱共采菊斓斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32904,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"携李","author":"谢矩","text":"嘉禾呈瑞表神州，负海连江拱上流。\n泽国风生太湖晓，华亭鹤唳九皋秋。\n读书堆废空陈迹，会景堂空感旧游。\n自愧行人穷历览，慨思今古不胜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32905,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵","author":"谢矩","text":"六朝事迹尽灰飞，千古江山自夕晖。\n晋殿吴宫云淡淡，宋陵梁墓草依依。\n鸡笼馆废踪还在，玉树庭空鹤已归。\n龙虎依然有佳气，五云深护帝王畿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32906,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮阴","author":"谢矩","text":"淮柳吹花风漫狂，平郊凝望叹兴亡。\n刘伶台下樽空酹，韩信祠前草已荒。\n笃行王祥真孝友，童年甘相妙文章。\n英贤逝矣知何在，人物于今迈汉唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32907,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"严先生祠","author":"谢矩","text":"碧水潺湲七里滩，白云缥缈富春山。\n玄纁自爱羊裘好，谏议何如钓叟閒。\n星象已占惊御座，故人犹自眇龙颜。\n君臣高大真奇遇，千古芳名不可扳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32908,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"袁安卧雪","author":"谢矩","text":"雨雪霖霖行路难，先生久矣困长安。\n剑书不羡朱门贵，布被都忘白屋寒。\n何意使君劳独问，由来人事不相干。\n孝廉名重当时举，未许终身赋考槃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32909,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次胡云屋南湖韵","author":"谢矩","text":"滕六呈祥散作花，梵王宫殿玉为家。\n林间渐见成银树，江上遥看尽白沙。\n寒拥貂裘围活火，暖同绛帐酌流霞。\n老禅清致谁能比，旋汲新泉为煮茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32910,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客馆次徐八见示韵","author":"谢矩","text":"晓起园林万玉加，纷纷衮衮乱周遮。\n冷凝岸柳难舒眼，寒压江梅不放花。\n银浪开时渔举网，青烟湿处客烹茶。\n侨居喜遇徐公子，好约归乘剡水槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32911,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山亭","author":"谢矩","text":"亭草萋萋一径微，升沈乌兔竟何归。\n客来拄笏风生爽，人醉钩帘雨过稀。\n逝水斜阳同一色，落霞孤鹜每齐飞。\n浮云富贵非吾欲，且向山中啖蕨薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32912,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"耕隐为胡拱辰赋","author":"谢矩","text":"幽居人事绝纷纭，俯仰深资寄耔耘。\n桑柘影深成委巷，烟花开满起清芬。\n春风绿涨犁锄雨，秋日黄连黍稌云。\n对此笑歌堪永岁，况闻贤器静脩勤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32913,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次鹿苑珦讲主韵","author":"谢矩","text":"路入南湖步屧迟，梵王宫阙每遐思。\n已知惠远许携酒，更爱巳公能赋诗。\n安静著身心地辟，萝云覆地月阴移。\n相逢愧我羁尘网，老大徒伤两鬓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32914,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑教授先生考满之京","author":"谢矩","text":"九载黉宫教雨施，又看考绩上京师。\n驿亭竹叶香浮斝，官路梅花雪亚枝。\n骥足升腾从此始，凤音书最复何疑。\n平安毋惜频频寄，千里云山有所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32915,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"椿庭寿日客中有感","author":"谢矩","text":"去岁兹辰捧寿觞，怜兄独客在他乡。\n茧窝春到歌筵暖，竹屋风生绮席凉。\n亲友举觞隆燕会，儿孙拜舞列鹓行。\n今年却愧身为客，回首家山欲断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32916,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次姚江散人","author":"谢矩","text":"车书一统圣皇恩，至泽均沾四海滨。\n作客远看淮甸月，放舟剩载武林春。\n伤心桃李随流俗，回首乡关少故人。\n便欲乘舟赋归去，云山依旧是比邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32917,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离家","author":"谢矩","text":"暮出闉阇赋远游，乘风缓步到江头。\n舟维渡口待潮发，月满沙边生客愁。\n良友论文欣裨益，生涯随分敢贪求。\n何时脱却江湖念，归老家园卜隐丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32918,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"镇江晚泊","author":"谢矩","text":"向吴亭下暮春晴，扬子江头晚汐平。\n云气倒连岚气湿，水光上接月光明。\n龙宫隐约金山寺，雉堞参差铁瓮城。\n闷倚篷窗成永叹，故乡千里独关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32919,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中书怀","author":"谢矩","text":"一春苔径绝行踪，耳目腰肢百病攻。\n写字读书閒白日，落花啼鸟任东风。\n老怀不向酕醄里，逸兴都归梦寐中。\n造物戏人何若此，倚栏搔首思冲冲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32920,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行","author":"谢矩","text":"纻服芒鞋兴趣长，溪山登濯足徜徉。\n翠岩雨过秋云暝，兰若风生夕沼凉。\n远浦渔歌来窈窕，空崖樵唱起微茫。\n诛茅便欲来居此，十亩园池一草堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32921,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瓢乐斋为陈医士赋用韵","author":"谢矩","text":"陋巷箪瓢乐所居，雅情真与世情疏。\n杏村雨过春丸药，竹户晴开昼读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32922,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"谢矩","text":"黄山门上早潮平，风送楼船一羽轻。\n鼓棹江阴始亭午，谩开樽酒慰羁情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32923,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶述","author":"谢矩","text":"少年时节竞繁华，老大无成只叹嗟。\n閒里春光今又半，梅花落尽到杨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32924,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬戴竹所惠七观石刻诗韵","author":"谢矩","text":"舂容雅制一团春，松雪精书八法新。\n珍重摹来情更厚，小窗展玩忆前人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32925,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题推篷图","author":"谢矩","text":"扁舟曾记酌西湖，笑倚东风醉莫扶。\n酒醒不知天已暮，梅花枝上月轮孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32926,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小画","author":"谢矩","text":"撒罢丝纶漾小舟，绿阴祗在水西头。\n得鱼换酒寻常事，日暮归来且暂休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32927,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次钱广文感怀","author":"谢矩","text":"茆斋清味自来甘，饮伴吟哦日醉酣。\n为问洛阳贤令尹，闭门风雨几人谙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32928,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题云山景","author":"谢矩","text":"山杳云深路更纡，绿杨深处结吾庐。\n春风淡荡鸟声寂，时有良朋访起居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32929,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五磊晴岚","author":"周礼","text":"雨歇云收山气浓，晓来遮遍翠芙蓉。\n小僮门外惊相报，失却前村五磊峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32930,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九湾红雨","author":"周礼","text":"桃花湾口锦云开，片片随风逐浪来。\n吹向前溪作红雨，却教刘阮问天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32931,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋水芙蓉","author":"周礼","text":"秋风隔岸木莲开，掩映红妆玉镜台。\n夜静月明环佩响，翠云屏里水仙来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32932,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斗室星临","author":"周礼","text":"绛烛烧残夜二更，佩声时杂步虚声。\n玉皇案下朝初罢，星汉无云斗柄横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32933,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题白衣送酒图","author":"周礼","text":"分田种秫酿新篘，祗为无心见督邮。\n若使白衣人不见，黄花孤负一年秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32934,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴","author":"李本","text":"世途何险巇，畴能两心托。\n囚楚竟怀沙，美新亦投阁。\n所以巢许流，韬光在岩壑。\n麋鹿为比邻，烟霞恣谈谑。\n富贵等浮云，俯仰无愧怍。\n峨峨富春山，清风洒寥廓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32935,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"李本","text":"青天际远水，落日明遥岑。\n奋袖拂苍石，憩此长松阴。\n凉飙洒露顶，正可弦吾琴。\n古调讵自秘，坐惜寡知音。\n美人隔秋水，望望烟波深。\n何当一晤语，旷然谐素心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32936,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"里人获苍鹿异之献于官遂作南山鹿","author":"李本","text":"南山鹿，山头有草林有木，朝朝出游暮归宿。\n文毛斓斑联锦钱，歧角嶙峋拔青玉。\n白日饥含洞口花，清泉渴饮岩边谷。\n胡为失脚落尘埃，也逐牛羊食人粟。\n牧儿惊见两角矗，传呼两两三三续。\n析木为兵石为炮，踰沟越陇相驰逐。\n一蹶仓皇折双足，持献长官脯其肉。\n呦呦不向嘉宾鸣，濯濯已辞灵囿伏。\n只念深山学仙客，谁与牵车下山麓。\n呜呼汝鹿最有山林情，汝乃何故丧其生。\n寄言云中猿鹤友，莫向人间借路行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32937,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送季温内兄从军","author":"李本","text":"四月五月南风狂，大麦小麦相亚黄。\n吴蚕成茧不及缫，慈母又缝游子裳。\n游子从军上京国，卖犊妆刀助行色。\n西亭出祖柳正长，骏马骄嘶羁不得。\n丈夫弧矢志四方，岂效儿女恋故乡。\n酒酣慷慨拔剑舞，青天白日飞?霜。\n圣皇开边固无战，地尽西南置州县。\n独怜残胡喘息存，深窜穷荒逞凶悍。\n君今名?行伍中，不用自誇两石弓。\n胸中筹画足制胜，好坐帷幄参元戎。\n马衔山前刁斗月，龙捲河上旌旗风。\n我武维扬号令肃，呼邪日逐争内附，凯歌入奏明光宫。\n从此朔南声教同，大开明堂议东封。\n君则长揖辞成功，归来听我击壤歌年丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32938,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤雁篇","author":"李本","text":"秋高八月风力狂，吹断长空征雁行。\n分飞汉月去影只，叫入楚云幽怨长。\n独夜愁迷荻浦雨，五更梦断芦田霜。\n枯吻连朝不饮啄，侧身万里遥相望。\n相望万里关塞隔，却忆平生长作客。\n随阳未饱稻粱谋，遵渚常虞网罗厄。\n蓟北江南三五群，秋凉春燠往来频。\n曾将捷书报边使，更联筝柱亲佳人。\n谁知中道两相失，漂泊天涯归未得。\n开口敢出号天声，畏人且塌搏风翼。\n锦水鸳鸯相并栖，画梁燕子双将雏。\n谁怜独有孤飞雁，岁岁江湖别离叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32939,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居为柯定安","author":"李本","text":"四百青山障俗氛，数家鸡犬自相闻。\n茆檐低碍岩前石，木榻高栖雨后云。\n晚径樵归凭鹿引，秋林果熟与猿分。\n从来懒入桃源市，自酿松花日半醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32940,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送天童寺","author":"李本","text":"青春廿里万松关，小白前瞻太白山。\n度岭路迷黄叶里，隔溪人语白云间。\n海龙护法听金磬，野鹿参禅献玉环。\n老衲相留成信宿，浮生赢得此偷閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32941,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经屠氏废宅","author":"李本","text":"桃源处士今何处，花落东风尚未归。\n旧业尽随芳草没，游魂暗逐断蓬飞。\n月台凤去琼箫咽，烟水鱼沈锦字稀。\n惟有画桥桥畔柳，春来依旧绿依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32942,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月湖夜泊","author":"李本","text":"卧听钟鼓隐层城，一枕烟波月二更。\n归梦不知乡树远，浮踪暗逐浪花轻。\n云埋丞相藏书坞，星落将军种柳营。\n尽道此中陈迹易，鸡鸣还有马蹄声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32943,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四虫言四首 其一 蜂","author":"李本","text":"翁翁复翁翁，汝俦谁与同。\n此翁不解世间事，世间老贱少为贵。\n恨不镊白还苍童，何用自口称翁翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32944,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四虫言四首 其二 蝉","author":"李本","text":"遮了遮了。\n主人屋破忙不补，只愁秋来长苦雨。\n南冈黄茆亦易求，何不剪取遮床头。\n城中尽是楼上楼，谁念中宵沾湿愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32945,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四虫言四首 其三 促织","author":"李本","text":"快织快织，两日催成绢一疋。\n严霜冻柏风断机，不辞深夜了残机。\n便从灯下试刀尺，寄到边城犹怪迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32946,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四虫言四首 其四 蜾蠃","author":"李本","text":"类我类我，休忘字卵。\n听我教诲勤，愿尔假作真。\n恩同骨肉长相亲。\n莫学人家放荡儿，少时父母长路歧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32947,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画马","author":"李本","text":"晚向天门立仗归，骄嘶谁与脱金鞿。\n銮舆近日希巡幸，閒放春堤苜蓿肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32948,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松鹤","author":"李本","text":"长松风入漱云涛，老鹤离巢刷羽毛。\n夜半道人骑过海，一轮秋月碧天高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宋徽宗画竹","author":"李本","text":"宣和殿下碧琅玕，月影风声岂耐寒。\n一自江南栽老桧，谁将消息报平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"李本","text":"溪头春水碧粼粼，溪上春山绝点尘。\n不信白云都占尽，也应茆屋有閒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东门行","author":"李悌谦","text":"朝入东门城，试作东门行。\n东门小吏打道开，马前高喝将军来。\n将军马上锦绣袍，妙年三十才向高。\n自信勋劳迈颇牧，常将意气淩萧曹。\n紫骝一疋天子赐，新鞲金鞍摇玉辔。\n腰下长悬两石弓，腹中岂贮三千字。\n清时校猎城南隅，旌旗蔽野人塞途。\n一时苍黄爪牙奋，百里飞走影响无。\n归来升堂设绮席，列坐击鼓吹笙竽。\n金凤钗横翠翘起，娇娥双双颜色都。\n藏阄呼取银错落，按节舞蹈红氍毹。\n蜡炬高烧白于昼，乐事已遍清夜徂。\n君不见穷巷书生读书苦，一生身被儒冠误。\n不思学剑求出身，闭门犹拟长杨赋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古二首 其一","author":"李悌谦","text":"驱车送君行，送君长亭道。\n落日照道周，君行何草草。\n结交既已晚，相去一何早。\n世路多险巇，君身讵能保。\n别时春草深，于今已枯槁。\n思君衣带缓，忆君容易老。\n愿为双鸿鹄，翻飞入穹昊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古二首 其二","author":"李悌谦","text":"盈盈楼上女，皎皎扬青眉。\n向天掩泪啼，恨深人莫知。\n我本良家子，误适商人儿。\n商人但趋利，不识生别离。\n前年贩茶去，海角复天涯。\n今年未有书，归期复何时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]